  "changes": [
    {
      "namespace": "ST_BtlAI",
      "key": "BtlAI0042",
      "source_hash": "9e786018",
      "old": "炸弹之父正在积蓄怒气……",
      "new": "爆弹之父正在积蓄怒气……",
      "english": "Dad Bomb is internalizing his anger..."
    },
    {
      "namespace": "ST_BtlAI",
      "key": "BtlAI0044",
      "source_hash": "c03b1f04",
      "old": "炸弹之父的怒气已蓄满！",
      "new": "爆弹之父的怒气已蓄满！",
      "english": "Dad Bomb has had enough!"
    },
    {
      "namespace": "ST_C01_001_06",
      "key": "001_06_007",
      "source_hash": "a3308287",
      "old": "百万火光！！",
      "new": "百万核爆！！",
      "english": "Megaflare!"
    },
    {
      "namespace": "ST_C01_Town_01Gra_05",
      "key": "Town_01Gra_05_055",
      "source_hash": "f4ab9a68",
      "old": "如果当时的以太是高级以太，\r\n我就不会输了……",
      "new": "如果当时的以太药是高级以太药，\r\n我就不会输了……",
      "english": "Dammit... I <text style=\"italic\">ethered</> when I should’ve <text style=\"italic\">turbo ethered</>. I would’ve had the fight if I did."
    },
    {
      "namespace": "ST_C03_306_01",
      "key": "306_01_013",
      "source_hash": "8f14f32d",
      "old": "嗯，老实说你们说得没错。\r\n我们现在缺人手缺到甚至想找莫古利帮忙。",
      "new": "嗯，老实说你们说得没错。\r\n我们现在缺人手缺到甚至想找莫古力帮忙。",
      "english": "Yes, if I’m being honest, it is as you say. We’re stretched thin like a flattened flan. Right now, we need all the help we can get."
    },
    {
      "namespace": "ST_C06_619_01A",
      "key": "619_01A_004",
      "source_hash": "a2c7fe6a",
      "old": "原来如此。\r\n那是炸弹的一种吧。\r\n必杀技……也就是要我们小心爆炸吧。",
      "new": "原来如此。\r\n那是爆弹怪的一种吧。\r\n必杀技……也就是要我们小心爆炸吧。",
      "english": "I see where this is going. That looks like the buff brother of a bomb, so the “deadly blow” part is telling us to watch out for its explosion."
    },
    {
