    {
      "namespace": "ST_ChrEv_2280_002_01",
      "key": "ChrEv_2280_002_01_039",
      "source_hash": "c66d6d65",
      "old": "而且最惨的是，我们还差点被那些\r\n没缩小的莫古利统治……",
      "new": "而且最惨的是，我们还差点被那些\r\n没缩小的莫古力统治……",
      "english": "We were on the cusp of having moogles as our new masters as well, for they were immune to the spell."
    },
    {
      "namespace": "ST_ChrEv_2280_002_01",
      "key": "ChrEv_2280_002_01_040",
      "source_hash": "e4390978",
      "old": "莫古利们居然……",
      "new": "莫古力们居然……",
      "english": "Moogle overlords? I’m not sure if I would’ve welcomed them..."
    },
    {
      "namespace": "ST_ChrEv_2280_005_01",
      "key": "ChrEv_2280_005_01_017",
      "source_hash": "55ac187b",
      "old": "天啊……\r\n明明她正在教我怎么施放火光的！",
      "new": "天啊……\r\n明明她正在教我怎么施放核爆的！",
      "english": "Yeah... And she was just about to teach me how to cast Flare!"
    },
